      "text": "Lord, who shall abide in thy tabernacle, Ps. 15:1. shall abide under the shadow of the Almighty, Ps. 91:1. One generation passeth … but the earth abideth for ever, Eccl. 1:4. If ye will still abide in this land, Jer. 42:10. the day of the Lord … who can abide it, Joel 2:11. But who may abide the day of his coming, Mal. 3:2.",
